WEBVTT

00:25.430 --> 00:26.720
Good to see you, everyone!

00:26.720 --> 00:29.430
Don't forget to
click the follow button, all right?

00:30.430 --> 00:31.700
Lu Guang, say something!

00:33.350 --> 00:35.430
Hi. Follow us.

00:48.250 --> 00:49.560
Who's this?

00:49.560 --> 00:51.390
My mom is taking my sister to the restroom.

00:52.910 --> 00:53.890
Hello, little boy

00:53.890 --> 00:55.770
This is the Mental Health Center.

00:55.770 --> 00:57.330
Did your mom call us

00:57.330 --> 00:58.830
for psychological counseling?

00:59.540 --> 01:01.180
Nobody in our family has mental illness.

01:06.620 --> 01:07.850
Tianchen.

01:07.850 --> 01:08.950
Who's that speaking?

01:10.160 --> 01:12.240
Well, just a crank call.

01:15.910 --> 01:18.160
Finally, we can meet with Dr. Qin today.

01:21.000 --> 01:22.180
He's not a fraud, huh?

01:24.620 --> 01:25.930
Don't talk nonsense.

01:25.930 --> 01:26.970
You scared your sister.

01:26.970 --> 01:29.470
I,I'll take care of her.

01:37.430 --> 01:40.350
This is a sign language
Xixi learned recently

01:40.350 --> 01:41.180
What does it mean?

01:42.790 --> 01:44.270
It means "good brother"

01:45.000 --> 01:46.350
You did it on purpose, right?

01:46.350 --> 01:47.120
Forget everything else

01:47.120 --> 01:48.040
But teach this first.

01:48.040 --> 01:49.540
Next one, come here.

01:51.200 --> 01:52.120
Coming

01:58.540 --> 01:59.430
Well then,

01:59.430 --> 02:00.660
what's bothering you?

02:01.330 --> 02:02.600
It's my daughter.

02:02.600 --> 02:05.270
She suddenly lost her voice six months ago

02:05.660 --> 02:07.430
We've seen many different doctors.

02:07.430 --> 02:08.600
But the cause couldn't be found.

02:09.830 --> 02:11.020
It's OK,

02:11.020 --> 02:11.850
I'm here.

04:12.290 --> 04:13.580
Get the hell out of here.

04:14.660 --> 04:16.970
Decide to be a coward now?

04:18.620 --> 04:21.580
Remember how arrogant you were
when insulting me?

04:59.290 --> 05:02.040
You all betrayed me, huh?

05:07.870 --> 05:08.990
Damn you all

05:09.520 --> 05:10.560
Xixi

05:12.160 --> 05:13.180
DAMN YOU ALL

05:25.680 --> 05:26.520
No

05:38.540 --> 05:39.290
Cheng Xiaoshi

05:41.910 --> 05:42.870
I'm fine

05:43.750 --> 05:45.720
just a few scratches.

06:27.890 --> 06:29.640
Lu Guang, you're still injured.

06:29.640 --> 06:30.770
Don't push yourself.

06:31.720 --> 06:32.560
Idiot

06:33.250 --> 06:34.950
You're not better than me in any way

06:50.790 --> 06:53.020
Tianchen

06:53.020 --> 06:54.830
I

06:54.830 --> 06:56.620
am scared.

07:00.000 --> 07:03.330
I miss

07:03.330 --> 07:05.080
mom.

07:50.370 --> 07:51.410
Lu Guang

08:10.080 --> 08:11.390
It's over.

08:11.390 --> 08:12.160
Qian Jin

08:30.910 --> 08:31.740
Now

08:33.290 --> 08:34.040
Run

08:37.910 --> 08:38.680
Run

08:47.290 --> 08:48.120
Li Tianchen

08:49.000 --> 08:49.790
Xiao Li,

08:50.660 --> 08:54.640
next Qingming Festival, burn some money
for Chen Bin and Wang Juan on my behalf

08:54.640 --> 08:57.160
Qian Jin, you bastard

09:12.450 --> 09:14.640
Qian Jin, stop it

09:56.870 --> 10:00.870
Qiao Ling

10:03.000 --> 10:05.040
Thank you

10:36.080 --> 10:36.870
Qiao Ling

10:38.750 --> 10:39.540
Qiao Ling

10:50.250 --> 10:52.350
If mediation doesn't work,

10:52.350 --> 10:54.020
you can try some legal means.

10:54.020 --> 10:55.600
and dissolve your marriage.

10:55.600 --> 10:57.200
I've considered getting a divorce.

10:58.080 --> 10:59.910
But my children are too young.

11:00.660 --> 11:03.370
Especially Xixi,
with her mental retardation.

11:04.370 --> 11:05.600
How can I handle all this alone

11:06.750 --> 11:08.140
I can help you.

11:08.870 --> 11:09.950
Thank you, Mr. Zhou.

11:10.700 --> 11:12.240
But I don't wanna bother you so often

11:14.220 --> 11:15.060
Xixi

11:18.450 --> 11:19.580
You are awake?

11:20.790 --> 11:21.790
Why are you crying?

11:22.580 --> 11:23.560
Had a nightmare?

11:25.540 --> 11:27.060
I don't want.

11:27.060 --> 11:29.580
I don't want mom and dad to separate

11:30.700 --> 11:33.910
Do you not want me anymore?

11:40.370 --> 11:42.220
Still cry, huh?

11:45.370 --> 11:47.770
Dare to kick me? You want to rebel

11:47.890 --> 11:48.580
Don't you?

11:50.890 --> 11:53.020
Your good days are over.

11:53.020 --> 11:55.240
I'm gonna kill you all

11:57.020 --> 11:58.430
Just wait,

11:59.080 --> 12:00.430
just you wait.

12:02.120 --> 12:02.810
What are you doing?

12:12.220 --> 12:14.120
My mom dare not resist you,

12:14.790 --> 12:16.270
Then I will do this.

12:16.270 --> 12:17.810
Psycho.

12:17.810 --> 12:19.240
You're also a psycho

13:07.000 --> 13:09.120
We get rid of that jerk forever, right?

13:43.120 --> 13:43.910
Hello.

13:45.200 --> 13:47.430
It's the first I greet you like this

13:47.430 --> 13:48.790
How magical!

13:53.370 --> 13:55.520
The baby's on the way.

13:55.520 --> 13:56.450
What a pity!

14:18.750 --> 14:22.120
S-O-R-R-Y

14:23.750 --> 14:25.370
Sorry

14:26.160 --> 14:30.370
Sorry

14:32.040 --> 14:33.950
Why can't I control myself?

14:42.390 --> 14:43.200
My girl,

14:44.430 --> 14:45.370
I'm sorry.

14:48.080 --> 14:50.200
I really wanna witness your growth.

14:51.290 --> 14:53.200
Hear your first words.

14:54.430 --> 14:56.520
Watch you learn to walk.

14:56.520 --> 14:58.660
Send you to school every day.

15:03.120 --> 15:07.330
Accompany you when you are sick.

15:08.700 --> 15:10.220
Hold your hand

15:10.750 --> 15:12.830
to give it to your spouse.

15:13.750 --> 15:16.390
And watch you become a mother.

15:18.450 --> 15:21.350
Sorry, my girl.

15:21.350 --> 15:22.100
Sorry, Sorry

15:23.700 --> 15:24.790
Sorry

15:25.750 --> 15:28.100
I'm not a good mother.

15:28.100 --> 15:32.430
I never knew how to love you
and protect you better

15:32.430 --> 15:34.370
from the beginning.

15:35.080 --> 15:36.160
I tried my best,

15:36.970 --> 15:38.180
But

15:38.180 --> 15:40.850
but why did things get
even worse after I tried?

15:40.850 --> 15:41.870
I don't want.

15:42.540 --> 15:44.910
I don't want mom and dad to separate.

15:46.120 --> 15:49.290
Do you not want me anymore?

15:50.120 --> 15:51.580
Sorry, Xixi

15:53.040 --> 15:53.950
Sorry

15:55.620 --> 15:57.890
I won't leave Dad,

15:58.020 --> 15:59.490
and won't leave you.

16:01.580 --> 16:02.830
We won't say

16:03.500 --> 16:05.560
what you heard today again,

16:05.560 --> 16:06.720
all right?

16:17.040 --> 16:17.640
How could that happen?

16:23.770 --> 16:24.640
Xixi

16:30.310 --> 16:31.430
Xixi

16:31.850 --> 16:32.890
Dad

16:32.890 --> 16:34.620
Are you sure this is the right way?

16:34.620 --> 16:36.180
It's here.

16:36.180 --> 16:38.120
Should we ask someone?

16:41.870 --> 16:42.640
Watch out

16:52.200 --> 16:52.990
Let me go

16:53.870 --> 16:55.700
Your friend dropped something.

16:58.450 --> 16:59.350
By the way

16:59.350 --> 17:01.470
Do you know how to get
to the Special Need Building?

17:17.910 --> 17:19.850
Looks like we went the wrong way.

17:19.850 --> 17:20.870
Let's go, let's go.

17:27.390 --> 17:30.140
This is a sign language
Xixi learned recently.

17:30.140 --> 17:31.330
What does it mean?

17:35.750 --> 17:37.520
It means "good brother"

17:37.890 --> 17:38.810
Well then,

17:38.810 --> 17:39.350
what's bothering you?

17:39.750 --> 17:42.560
She suddenly lost her voice six months ago.

17:42.560 --> 17:44.520
We've seen many different doctors.

17:44.520 --> 17:45.140
But the cause couldn't be found.

17:46.140 --> 17:47.390
Hello, little boy.

17:47.390 --> 17:49.100
This is the Mental Health Center.

17:49.100 --> 17:50.700
Did your mom call us

17:50.700 --> 17:52.160
for psychological counseling

17:53.350 --> 17:55.720
It's OK. I'm here.

18:08.040 --> 18:10.990
Mom, in the end of the story.

18:11.000 --> 18:13.290
Did the siblings find their way home?

18:31.830 --> 18:32.660
Qiao Ling

18:35.580 --> 18:37.620
Qiao Ling, what's wrong?

18:38.830 --> 18:39.430
Qiao Ling

18:55.700 --> 18:56.540
Mr. Liu

18:57.560 --> 18:58.100
Here

19:05.250 --> 19:06.680
I'm in the car now.

19:06.680 --> 19:07.810
No worries, Mom

19:14.040 --> 19:15.160
During the years I've been abroad.

19:16.000 --> 19:17.310
Indeed, many things have happened.

19:18.080 --> 19:19.220
Yes

19:19.220 --> 19:21.120
Liu Min just died like that.

19:21.120 --> 19:22.910
Well, that takes a weight off my shoulders.

19:23.720 --> 19:24.740
Alright.

19:24.750 --> 19:26.060
Let's not talk about it anymore.

19:26.060 --> 19:27.970
Hurry back and spend
some time with your dad.

19:27.970 --> 19:29.390
Before going back,

19:29.390 --> 19:30.580
I need to go somewhere first.

19:32.450 --> 19:33.350
For what?

19:35.910 --> 19:36.870
To meet an old friend.

19:55.950 --> 19:56.790
I said,

19:57.830 --> 19:59.680
we will definitely meet again.

20:11.350 --> 20:13.310
congratulations

20:17.580 --> 20:19.890
Why did Li Tianxi's memory

20:19.890 --> 20:21.700
suddenly flood into my mind that day?

20:22.790 --> 20:25.660
Even with fragments of memories
she saw from other people,

20:29.540 --> 20:30.330
including..

20:30.810 --> 20:34.640
Could you please help us find Lu Guang?

20:34.640 --> 20:38.470
I know you can see Lu Guang's
current situation through this photo,

20:55.080 --> 20:56.660
and Lu Guang's memories.

21:02.430 --> 21:03.470
Here

21:03.470 --> 21:04.520
The stuff you want.

21:05.160 --> 21:06.200
Liu Min's phone.

21:09.290 --> 21:10.470
How about you?

21:10.470 --> 21:11.430
Have you made up your mind?

21:13.620 --> 21:14.910
Do I have other choices?

21:17.080 --> 21:20.080
It seems everyone has only
one path in their destiny.

21:20.950 --> 21:21.720
But in fact,

21:22.830 --> 21:24.660
it is made up of countless parallel lines

21:27.870 --> 21:29.910
It can be driven by one's personality

21:37.200 --> 21:38.930
And can also change with
the influence of others.

21:51.200 --> 21:52.580
Sometimes we wanna change it.

21:53.680 --> 21:54.700
But we can't.

21:57.720 --> 21:58.890
Damn you all

22:06.930 --> 22:07.930
No

22:17.290 --> 22:18.870
Why does Lu Guang's memory

22:19.580 --> 22:21.930
contain the scene of Cheng Xiaoshi's death?

22:21.930 --> 22:23.790
Boss,please

22:24.890 --> 22:27.220
Maybe l'm overthinking it.

22:28.870 --> 22:29.790
Easy, guys.

22:31.830 --> 22:33.830
Finally, we're back

22:35.910 --> 22:37.220
Are you still pretending to be disabled?

22:43.290 --> 22:44.720
Home, sweet home.

22:44.720 --> 22:46.740
Welcome back, two discharged patients.

22:49.120 --> 22:50.810
No rent for these two months, please.

22:51.450 --> 22:52.640
Cheng Xiaoshi,

22:52.640 --> 22:54.080
can't you feel the atmosphere now?

22:55.080 --> 22:56.540
What atmosphere?

22:59.200 --> 23:00.290
Thanks to the landlady

23:00.290 --> 23:01.470
for preparing a welcome feast for us

23:02.370 --> 23:02.910
Come on

23:02.910 --> 23:04.240
Lu Guang, help me

23:04.250 --> 23:05.450
Come on, come on!

23:07.950 --> 23:09.770
Hey, Lu Guang

23:11.700 --> 23:13.470
You're too heartless,

23:13.470 --> 23:15.660
forgetting about your bro
in face of food and drink.

23:19.040 --> 23:20.310
Captain Xiao

23:20.310 --> 23:21.540
How's Officer Wang?

23:22.620 --> 23:24.080
She has been out of danger,

23:25.040 --> 23:26.950
gradually recovering now.

23:29.140 --> 23:32.560
Now a special task force
has been established

23:32.560 --> 23:33.790
for such crimes that
involve paranormal abilities.

23:34.450 --> 23:36.140
I'm in charge.

23:36.140 --> 23:38.890
I wanna bring more parallel lines together.

23:38.890 --> 23:40.120
To turn all uncertainties

23:41.120 --> 23:42.060
into certainties.

23:42.750 --> 23:44.270
Is it really possible?

23:49.580 --> 23:50.770
If you don't have the guts for that,

23:51.750 --> 23:52.870
how can you be my friend?

24:03.660 --> 24:05.020
You dropped something.

24:05.020 --> 24:06.450
I don't need it anymore.

24:17.450 --> 24:19.220
I've had those healthy
patient meals for a month

24:19.220 --> 24:21.200
Now only junk food can satisfy me

24:24.040 --> 24:25.640
Lu Guang, why don't you eat?

24:27.830 --> 24:29.970
Sorry, Cheng Xiaoshi,

24:34.080 --> 24:35.640
I'm always telling you

24:35.640 --> 24:36.560
not to change the past,

24:38.750 --> 24:39.890
but I couldn't follow my own words.

24:41.720 --> 24:44.680
Even if I know that death
is an unchangeable point

24:45.870 --> 24:47.620
I still wanna use the last chance

24:48.830 --> 24:50.040
to return to the beginning

24:52.370 --> 24:53.410
and save you.
